sequenceDiagram
  actor Driver
  participant ReservationController
  participant ReservationViewModel
  participant ReservationService
  participant PersistenceState
  participant PricingService
  Driver->>ReservationController: Enter driver and choose slot
  ReservationController->>ReservationViewModel: update fields
  ReservationViewModel->>PricingService: quote selected slot
  PricingService-->>ReservationViewModel: line items and total
  Driver->>ReservationController: Confirm reservation
  ReservationController->>ReservationViewModel: confirm()
  ReservationViewModel->>ReservationService: create(reservations, driverId, slotId)
  ReservationService->>PersistenceState: check confirmed slot conflicts
  PersistenceState-->>ReservationService: slot available
  ReservationService-->>ReservationViewModel: CONFIRMED Reservation
  ReservationViewModel-->>ReservationController: confirmation ID
